  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock id="HHEBA1CD44839C108D1DAFD6DE3427BE45" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;8. None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock id="HH22FBAEA0509E80B804A4341B1670898A" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p style="text-align: justify;"&gt;9.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;span style="font-family: 'MS Reference Sans Serif'; font-size: 14.6667px; white-space: pre-wrap;"&gt;On July 18, 2018, in Docket No. PL17-1-001, the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission dismissed the requests for rehearing and clarification of its revised policy statement on treatment of income taxes and provided guidance regarding the treatment of accumulated deferred income taxes in light of its revised policy. Inquiry Regarding the Commission's Policy for Recovery of Income Tax Costs, Order on Rehearing of Revised Policy Statement, 164 FERC 61,030 (Jul. 18, 2018). Pursuant to the guidance provided by the Commission in its July 18 Order, Saltville Gas Storage Company, LLC, an indirect wholly-owned subsidiary of Spectra Energy Partners, LP, a master limited partnership, intends to remove any balances recorded in Accounts 190, 281, 282, and 283 of the Commission's Uniform System of Accounts, as well as excess ADIT that has been transferred to Account 254 and deficient ADIT that has been transferred to Account 182.3. Saltville Gas Storage Company, LLC has requested approval from the Chief Accountant of the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission to implement the accounting entries necessary for removing these balances. Upon receipt of the Chief Accountant's approval, Saltville Gas Storage Company, LLC will reflect the removal of these balances in the annual and quarterly financing reporting required by Part 260 of the Commission's regulations. On November 27, 2023, Spectra Energy Partners, LP, a subsidiary of Enbridge Inc., filed with the Commission in Docket No. AC18-220-000 a request on behalf of certain of Spectra Energy Partners, LP's pipeline and affiliates, including Saltville Gas Storage Company, LLC, for a Motion for Action on its September 10, 2018 request for approval of accounting entries in this proceeding.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfMateriallyImportantTransactionsOfTheRespondentNotDisclosedElsewhereTextBlock id="HH582A4E700260C05D782FA2D6F218758A" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;10. None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfMateriallyImportantTransactionsOfTheRespondentNotDisclosedElsewhereTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedIncreaseOrDecreaseInAnnualRevenuesCausedByImportantRateChangesTextBlock id="HHE60759687E403C6B3DE58B8464A791E0" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;11. None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedIncreaseOrDecreaseInAnnualRevenuesCausedByImportantRateChangesTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id="HHC9E9219375AC2F82A8CDFAF00D88FECC" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;12.&amp;#160;&lt;span style="font-size: 0.9rem;"&gt;Removals, effective 06/01/2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;Berry, David L., Controller&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;Watson, Robert J., Vice President, Project Execution&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;Removal, effective 06/22/2026&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;Neyland, Stephen J., Vice President - Finance&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;Appointments, effective 06/01/2026&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;Johnson, Ryan M., Controller&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;Berry, David L., Vice President&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;Moore, Anne N., Vice President, Major Projects&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;Tessin, Caitlin L., Vice President, Commercial Gas Transmission and Midstream&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;Appointment, effective 06/22/2026&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;Khan, Zeyd A., Vice President - Finance&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock id="HHD790CCB2EDB33AB49E3957CEAFD4E7D7" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;13. None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock>
  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HHFB845F6A13C048AB10E053139FD9FDD6" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p style="font-size: 14px; text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: inherit;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;NOTES TO FINANCIAL STATEMENTS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="font-size: 14px; text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: inherit;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;For the Six Months Ended June 30, 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;"&gt;These interim financial statements should be read in conjunction with the financial statements and notes thereto contained in the Form 2-A of Saltville Gas Storage Company LLC (Saltville), for the year ended December 31, 2025. These financial statements are unaudited, but in management&amp;#8217;s opinion, reflect all normal recurring adjustments that are necessary for a fair presentation of financial position, results of operations and cash flows for the period presented. The results as presented for this interim period are not necessarily indicative of results to be achieved for the full year. Certain information and notes which would substantially duplicate the disclosures contained in the most recent FERC Form 2 have been omitted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantDisclosuresRegardingTheFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HH26F298D96F05ADD051F0C74B218AC0A3" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4"></ferc:DisclosureOfImportantDisclosuresRegardingTheFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
