    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH135E238A5C5003B5B92D72DA17587B54" xlink:to="HH1AE94D706DECD7318F44C7A2128B6C1B" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH5C34F0D2D0A74E3EEF3ECAD810C156CE" xlink:label="HH5C34F0D2D0A74E3EEF3ECAD810C156CE" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH33EC93F501F68D06D96807E4BCAF5908" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Our valuation of the net excesses or deficiencies which result from shipper supplied gas, as well as the valuation of the dispositions of excesses and the sources of deficiencies, is based upon the monthly market average index prices from the Cashout Rate Calculation for East Tennessee Natural Gas, LLC</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH5C34F0D2D0A74E3EEF3ECAD810C156CE" xlink:to="HH33EC93F501F68D06D96807E4BCAF5908" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH9AE5148E87876092B313B62D96D26339" xlink:label="HH9AE5148E87876092B313B62D96D26339" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH5AD12E334B13BBC086BF0CE63BC2AC9A" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>ASC 980-710-25, "Accounting for the Effects of Certain Types of Regulation" contains discussion of the regulatory accounting implications of recording accrued vacation under ASC 710-10-2..</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH9AE5148E87876092B313B62D96D26339" xlink:to="HH5AD12E334B13BBC086BF0CE63BC2AC9A" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH937AC867655CE000577E71304302031D" xlink:label="HH937AC867655CE000577E71304302031D" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH0A6AD199A2FD7A98244E6DF9BA08A68F" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Docket No. AI93-5-001 issued on April 23, 1993 (Accounting for Income Taxes).</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH937AC867655CE000577E71304302031D" xlink:to="HH0A6AD199A2FD7A98244E6DF9BA08A68F" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH79C88CA8D43B55F58D17BFF57FE255A0" xlink:label="HH79C88CA8D43B55F58D17BFF57FE255A0" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH0D8FB01BCD15D3F89FD481BBC0474EE2" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Recorded pursuant to 18 CFR 154.402(a) and 18 CFR 382.202.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH79C88CA8D43B55F58D17BFF57FE255A0" xlink:to="HH0D8FB01BCD15D3F89FD481BBC0474EE2" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHCC676E1FFFDF8C1C09005ADD274491AC" xlink:label="HHCC676E1FFFDF8C1C09005ADD274491AC" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH02F9C1CCA7C25112E202D16AE814AB67" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Relates to the establishment of a regulatory liability as a result of the U.S. tax reform legislation dated December 22, 2017.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHCC676E1FFFDF8C1C09005ADD274491AC" xlink:to="HH02F9C1CCA7C25112E202D16AE814AB67" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH3646FBC02348A08AD0A46F8029A4E906" xlink:label="HH3646FBC02348A08AD0A46F8029A4E906" />
